.uisai.a'u.io.i'osai bAnli gUnka doi ro da poi gUnka la'o .gy. Lojban
Wikipedia .gy.

I am amazed at how much effort you must have put in to make this happen. I'm
sure the rest of the Lojban community must agree that you have done an
amazing good deed. From myself personally however, I would like to
congradulate you with your great success. .a'o do fInti so'i da poi lo du'u
bAnli .i .a'o mi vIska  da .i .ui morji roroi  da poi kakne zoi .gy. be
improve .gy.

.i ki'e .IAnis.


mu'omi'e lOkadin.

